"# Milestone 01 — The Quantitative Skeleton\n\n**Time:** ~5 hours | **Artifact:** frequency tables + description-only narrative\n\nNumbers first. Interpretation later — and separately.\n\n## Do\n1. Frequency distribution per question, n reported\n2. Three justified cross-tabs\n3. One-sentence description (not interpretation) per finding\n\n## Reflection\nWhich finding most tempted you to interpret rather than describe?"
